SUMMARY:Jim Florentine LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa
DTSTAMP:20260820T033115Z
DTSTART:20260819T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nJim Florentine LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tu
	lsa\nGet ready for a night of raw\, unfiltered comedy as Jim Florentine ta
	kes the stage at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa. Known for his sharp wit\, br
	utally honest observations\, and no-holds-barred delivery\, Florentine is 
	one of stand-up comedy’s most authentic voices. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wed
	nesday\, August 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Bric
	ktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK 74135\nAge 
	Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Prices: $68 – $127 (General Admission & VIP)
	 \nAbout Jim Florentine\nJim Florentine is a veteran stand-up comedian\, p
	odcast host\, and television personality best known for his appearances on
	 Howard Stern\, Opie & Anthony\, and as a co-host of VH1 Classic’s That Me
	tal Show. With a career spanning over two decades\, Florentine has built a
	 devoted following with his unapologetically honest\, blue-collar humor th
	at tackles everyday life with fearless candor. He has released multiple st
	and-up specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds. \nWha
	t to Expect\n\nRaw\, unfiltered stand-up comedy with no topic off-limits\n
	Sharp observations on relationships\, pop culture\, and everyday life\nInt
	imate comedy club atmosphere at Bricktown Comedy Club\nOne of stand-up’s m
	ost authentic and fearless voices\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Tul
	sa\, Oklahoma\n\nVenue Information\nBricktown Comedy Club Tulsa is Tulsa’s
	 premier destination for live stand-up comedy\, located at 5982 S Yale Ave
	. The intimate venue features a full bar and dining menu\, ensuring a comp
	lete entertainment experience. No seat is far from the stage\, making ever
	y show feel up-close and personal. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Jim F
	lorentine at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa start at $68 for General Admissio
	n and go up to $127 for VIP General Admission. Only 44 tickets remain — do
	n’t miss out! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains a
	ffiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our l
	inks at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to 
	change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalenda
	r.com/event/jim-florentine-live-at-bricktown-comedy-club-tulsa/\n\nFrom Co
	medy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jim-florentine-live-at-bricktown-comed
	y-club-tulsa/
LOCATION:Bricktown Comedy Club\, 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK\, 74135\, Uni
	ted States
